{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-09_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-09","title":"徹入骨髓","storyCode":"4-9","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"fb898a9eb5d1b037acbc6c4aa11ce06af6082c4bde423c2888ac0f6a728ef550","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"隕星......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡究竟看到了什麼......？你們也在一起嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"......你最好還是不知道為妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"不是什麼戰略上的問題......就先別關心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"還想藏到什麼時候呢？羅德島的小蟲子們？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（——！梅菲斯特！他發現我們的蹤跡了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"（別出聲。還沒有，這是他慣用的伎倆。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，啊，不想出來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"別以為我沒看見你們增援的隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"也罷。算了，我有些東西要給你們看。你們會喜歡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來——自一開始，我們就是要接管整個切爾諾伯格......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"等待，等待，等待了那麼久......終於等到這個時刻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這個向烏薩斯、向迫害我們感染者的人復仇的時刻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，這個分城的這些傢伙呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他們逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他們反應很快。在我們動手之前，就逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"解開了地區鎖，開足了馬力，動用一切移動手段——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們又能逃到哪裡去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的同胞，早就在各個城區中潛伏著，尋找著機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"最終他們被我們追上，得到了應有的懲罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這些懦夫，這些施暴者，我們該怎麼處理他們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是——讓他們成為一個標誌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"一個宣告感染者身上的一切不公，終將被摧毀的標誌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"——沒錯，那就是，整合運動的標誌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"讓它們一個個都成為恐怖的象徵吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，去點燃那個標誌！照亮周圍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，照亮這個城市吧！讓羅德島看看軟弱的壓迫者們的末路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"（——不！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（迅速掩住阿米婭的雙眼）","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士——？！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"別看！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......惡毒和瘋狂堆成的焚爐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。請挪開你的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒問題的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——不，你必須讓我看見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"他的行為總有一天，是我需要面對的，更何況以前也……"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（鬆開手）","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"潔西卡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"潔西卡，冷靜點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"隕星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——可惡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜葉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......真是作孽......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那些焦臭味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還要躲多久呢，切爾諾伯格的那隻兔子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才你們幾個就悄悄摸摸的，我還以為你們要做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"結果也只能默默看著嗎......真的很無趣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，你還帶了不少人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"這些，都是你做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"當然了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"不運用恐怖的手段，如何減少損失呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"只要十分之一的人的死——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"就能恐嚇住剩下十分之九的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是，最有效的減少傷亡的措施呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——————"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經不是當時的我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然你不記得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，當時的我又膽小又脆弱，很容易就感到害怕......依靠著你，我才能向前走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我看上去依然是那副模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在的我，見過的慘劇已經夠多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然不想再看到這種事情發生"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......但不去面對它們是不行的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我要提醒自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我還不能退後——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我還要繼續戰鬥下去!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合運動成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["？？？","梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["霜葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["隕星"]}]}
